_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968790/extras/da3629f1b7acf5d4368bde7680ddf59f.avif?t=1668105725\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics-inspired precision platformer<br></li><li>70 levels<br></li><li>More than 750 screens of gameplay<br></li><li>~20 hour long main campaign<br></li><li>Dark worlds with extra challenging levels<br></li><li>Collect diskettes to learn more about the story of the world<br></li><li>Fully fledged level editor</li></ul><br><i>Uncover the secret of your existence</i>",
